.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH db 1  "db " 
.SH NAME
db \- Database maintenance: check, vacuum, stats, backup
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdb\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Database maintenance: check, vacuum, stats, backup
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
db\-check(1)
Run integrity check on all databases
.TP
db\-vacuum(1)
Run VACUUM to reclaim space in all databases
.TP
db\-stats(1)
Show database sizes and table statistics
.TP
db\-backup(1)
Back up all databases to a directory
.TP
db\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
